Targets: wasm
Releases: 12.0-
Subject: Skip the "do not run as root" check in the WebAssembly build
Purpose: PostgreSQL refuses to start as root (geteuid() == 0) to protect the host. Emscripten reports user 0 to every program, whether it runs in a browser or under node in a build container, and there is no host account to protect: the module runs inside the sandbox of its host. The check is skipped only when __EMSCRIPTEN__ is defined. 9.2.9 added the variable do_check_root to main() (the root check is skipped for --describe-config and -C), so the lines around this hunk of main.c are different; this variant is for 9.2.9 and later, the sibling without it for the earlier releases. 9.3.5 added do_check_root to main() again (as 9.2.9 did), so this is the same patch as its sibling for 9.2.9 to 9.2.24, kept as a file of its own because the releases before 9.3.5 need the other variant: a patch has one range of releases. In 9.3 initdb.c spells xstrdup() pg_strdup(), so the line this patch adds uses pg_strdup(). This variant is for 9.4, where the user name is looked up in src/common/username.c (patch 0230) and initdb.c has only the root check in get_id(); the sibling for 9.3 is capped at 9.3.25. This variant is for 12, where initdb.c reports the root check with pg_log_error(), so the lines around the hunks of get_id() are different; the sibling for 9.4 to 11 is capped at 11.22.
Components: src/backend/main/main.c, src/bin/initdb/initdb.c
Checks: postgres --version and postgres --single run under node as root (scripts/test-wasm-node.sh); initdb creates the template data directory as root (scripts/build-wasm.sh)
Origin: own

diff --git a/src/backend/main/main.c b/src/backend/main/main.c
--- a/src/backend/main/main.c
+++ b/src/backend/main/main.c
@@ -194,8 +194,11 @@
 	 * Make sure we are not running as root, unless it's safe for the selected
 	 * option.
 	 */
+#ifndef __EMSCRIPTEN__
+	/* (the WebAssembly host reports uid 0 to everyone and has no account to protect) */
 	if (do_check_root)
 		check_root(progname);
+#endif
 
 	/*
 	 * Dispatch to one of various subprograms depending on first argument.
diff --git a/src/bin/initdb/initdb.c b/src/bin/initdb/initdb.c
--- a/src/bin/initdb/initdb.c
+++ b/src/bin/initdb/initdb.c
@@ -646,6 +646,8 @@
 	const char *username;
 
 #ifndef WIN32
+/* the WebAssembly host reports uid 0 to everyone and has no account to protect */
+#ifndef __EMSCRIPTEN__
 	if (geteuid() == 0)			/* 0 is root's uid */
 	{
 		pg_log_error("cannot be run as root");
@@ -655,6 +657,7 @@
 		exit(1);
 	}
 #endif
+#endif
 
 	username = get_user_name_or_exit(progname);
 
